#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.linear_model.LinearRegression.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.linear\\_model.LinearRegression"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:1 of
msgid "Ordinary least squares Linear Regression."
msgstr "普通最小二乘线性回归。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:3 of
msgid ""
"LinearRegression fits a linear model with coefficients w = (w1, ..., wp) "
"to minimize the residual sum of squares between the observed targets in "
"the dataset, and the targets predicted by the linear approximation."
msgstr ""
"LinearRegression 使用系数 w = (w1, ..., wp) 拟合一个线性模型，以最小化"
"数据集中观测目标与线性近似预测目标之间的残差平方和。"

#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.linear_model.LinearRegression.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:7 of
msgid ""
"Whether to calculate the intercept for this model. If set to False, no "
"intercept will be used in calculations (i.e. data is expected to be "
"centered)."
msgstr ""
"是否为此模型计算截距。如果设置为 False，则在计算中不会使用截距（即数据"
"预期是中心化的）。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:11 of
msgid ""
"This parameter is ignored when ``fit_intercept`` is set to False. If "
"True, the regressors X will be normalized before regression by "
"subtracting the mean and dividing by the l2-norm. If you wish to "
"standardize, please use :class:`~sklearn.preprocessing.StandardScaler` "
"before calling ``fit`` on an estimator with ``normalize=False``."
msgstr ""
"当 ``fit_intercept`` 设置为 False 时，此参数被忽略。如果为 True，则在回归"
"之前通过减去均值并除以 l2 范数来标准化回归变量 X。如果您希望进行标准化，"
"请在对 ``normalize=False`` 的估计器调用 ``fit`` 之前使用 :class:`~sklearn"
".preprocessing.StandardScaler`。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:18 of
msgid "If True, X will be copied; else, it may be overwritten."
msgstr "如果为 True，X 将被复制；否则，它可能会被覆盖。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:20 of
msgid ""
"When set to ``True``, forces the coefficients to be positive. This option"
" is only supported for dense arrays."
msgstr "当设置为 ``True`` 时，强制系数为正数。此选项仅支持密集数组。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:26 of
msgid ""
"Estimated coefficients for the linear regression problem. If multiple "
"targets are passed during the fit (y 2D), this is a 2D array of shape "
"(n_targets, n_features), while if only one target is passed, this is a 1D"
" array of length n_features."
msgstr ""
"线性回归问题的估计系数。如果在拟合期间传递了多个目标（y 为二维），这是"
"一个形状为 (n_targets, n_features) 的二维数组，而如果只传递了一个目标，"
"这是一个长度为 n_features 的一维数组。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression of
msgid "type"
msgstr "类型"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:31 of
msgid "array of shape (n_features, ) or (n_targets, n_features)"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:35 of
msgid "Rank of matrix `X`. Only available when `X` is dense."
msgstr "矩阵 `X` 的秩。仅在 `X` 为密集矩阵时可用。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:37
#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:56 of
msgid "int"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:41 of
msgid "Singular values of `X`. Only available when `X` is dense."
msgstr "`X` 的奇异值。仅在 `X` 为密集矩阵时可用。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:43 of
msgid "array of shape (min(X, y),)"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:47 of
msgid ""
"Independent term in the linear model. Set to 0.0 if `fit_intercept = "
"False`."
msgstr "线性模型中的独立项。如果 `fit_intercept = False`，则设置为 0.0。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:50 of
msgid "float or array of shape (n_targets,)"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:54 of
msgid "Number of features seen during :term:`fit`."
msgstr ":term:`fit` 期间看到的特征数量。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:60 of
msgid ":py:obj:`Ridge`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:61 of
msgid ""
"Ridge regression addresses some of the problems of Ordinary Least Squares"
" by imposing a penalty on the size of the coefficients with l2 "
"regularization."
msgstr "岭回归通过使用 l2 正则化对系数大小施加惩罚来解决普通最小二乘法的一些问题。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:63 of
msgid ":py:obj:`Lasso`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:64 of
msgid ""
"The Lasso is a linear model that estimates sparse coefficients with l1 "
"regularization."
msgstr "Lasso 是一种使用 l1 正则化估计稀疏系数的线性模型。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:66 of
msgid ":py:obj:`ElasticNet`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._lin_reg.LinearRegression:67 of
msgid ""
"Elastic-Net is a linear regression model trained with both l1 and l2 "
"-norm regularization of the coefficients."
msgstr "Elastic-Net 是一种线性回归模型，使用系数的 l1 和 l2 范数正则化进行训练。"

